# Build progress

`docs/build-progress.md` is the step-by-step checklist for `Veteran_Claims_Buddy_Engineering_Handoff.md`.

Before implementing, read the current position in that file and continue from the first open item.

When a step finishes, blocks, or is newly expanded from the handoff, update `docs/build-progress.md` in the same change. Do not mark a phase complete while any of its items are open. Stop at owner gates.

`docs/page-navigation.md` wins for screens and routes. Do not start a later build-sequence step until its checklist has been expanded into `docs/build-progress.md`.
